## Verification gates

Each product repository's `AGENTS.md` lists its lint, format, test and visual
gates; all of them must pass before a pull request is opened or repaired. In
this repository: keep the `.specify/` scripts and templates unchanged unless a
decision records the change, and read every changed spec, plan and task list
in full.

## Conventions

- Branch prefixes: `feat/ fix/ refactor/ infra/ docs/ test/ chore/`.
- **Conventional Commits**; imperative subject of at most 70 characters; the
  body says *why*.
- Never log secrets, tokens or authenticated URLs.

When in doubt: this file for coordination, each repository's `AGENTS.md` for
in-repository discipline, `specs/` for new work.

